      <tr><th>配額<br><span class="term">quota</span><br>（須低於 Q*）</th><td>減至 Q̄</td><td><strong>跌</strong></td><td>可升可跌</td><td>無（除非拍賣配額）</td><td>Q̄ 至 Q*，位置與上限相同</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>

  <div class="blk frame"><span class="blk-lbl">答題框架：「用供求圖分析某干預對 CS、PS 及效率的影響」</span>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>畫底圖</strong>：D、S、E、P*、Q* 五個標籤缺一不可。</li>
      <li><strong>加入干預</strong>：上限／下限畫<strong>水平</strong>線（並註明在 P* 之上／之下）、稅或補貼畫<strong>第二條供給曲線</strong>並標明移動量、配額畫<strong>垂直</strong>線。</li>
      <li><strong>找實際成交量</strong>：寫出 <span class="kw">the quantity transacted falls from Q* to …</span>，並解釋為什麼取那一邊（買賣雙方取細者）。</li>
      <li><strong>逐一比較面積</strong>：<span class="kw">consumer surplus decreases / increases / may increase or decrease</span>、<span class="kw">producer surplus …</span>，用陰影或字母（a、b、c）指明是哪一塊。</li>
      <li><strong>如有政府收支</strong>：標出 <span class="kw">tax revenue</span> 或 <span class="kw">government expenditure on subsidy</span> 的長方形，並說明它是轉移而非損失（補貼則是社會要付出的資源）。</li>
      <li><strong>結論效率</strong>：標出三角形，寫 <span class="kw">deadweight loss</span>，加一句 <span class="kw">total social surplus decreases, so resource allocation becomes inefficient</span>；並指明是 <span class="kw">under-production</span> 抑或 <span class="kw">over-production</span>。</li>
    </ol></div>

  <div class="blk note"><span class="blk-lbl">前後連結</span>
    <p>這一節的圖與 <strong>Topic C</strong> 的價格管制、稅項歸宿（tax incidence）完全共用同一套圖 —— 分別在於 Topic C 問「價量怎樣變、誰承擔稅」，Topic E 問「CS／PS／DWL 怎樣變」。稅與補貼由買賣雙方各承擔多少，取決於<strong>需求與供給的價格彈性</strong>（Topic C）；同一稅額，兩邊彈性越大，成交量減得越多，<strong>DWL 越大</strong>。下一節（E2）會鬆開「私人成本 ＝ 社會成本」這個假設，你會發現稅與補貼在有外部效應時可以<strong>改善</strong>效率。<strong>Topic I</strong> 的財政政策會再用到稅收與政府支出這兩個長方形。</p></div>

  <div class="quiz" data-quiz="E1"></div>
</section>

<section class="pg" id="pg-E2">
  <div class="phead"><span class="ltr">Topic E · 第 2 節</span>
    <h1>私人成本（利益）與社會成本（利益）的分歧</h1>
    <p class="en">Divergence between private and social costs (benefits): market versus government solutions</p>
    <p class="lede">上一節假設「私人成本就是社會成本」，所以市場均衡有效率。這一節鬆開這個假設：當你的行為令<strong>第三者</strong>受害或受惠，市場就會生產得太多或太少。官方對這一節有一個很重要的限制 —— <strong>只要求用例子討論，不要求用圖</strong>。所以這一節的分數全在「例子講得準不準、over／under 講得對不對」。</p>
  </div>

  <h2><span class="kp">Key point (iii)</span>四組概念：私人／外部／社會，成本／利益</h2>
  <p class="h2en">Private, external and social costs and benefits</p>

  <div class="blk def"><span class="blk-lbl">定義</span>
    <b>私人成本</b><span class="term-en">Private cost — the cost borne by the decision maker himself</span>
    <p>做決定的人<strong>自己承擔</strong>的成本。工廠的私人成本 ＝ 原料、工資、租金、電費。</p>
    <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>外部成本</strong> <span class="term">External cost</span> — the cost borne by third parties who are not involved in the decision，即<strong>由第三者承受、決策者不用付</strong>的成本。</p>
    <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>社會成本</strong> <span class="term">Social cost</span> — the total cost borne by the whole society。</p>
    <div class="formula">社會成本 <b>Social cost</b> ＝ 私人成本 <b>Private cost</b> ＋ 外部成本 <b>External cost</b></div></div>

  <div class="blk def"><span class="blk-lbl">定義</span>
    <b>私人／外部／社會利益</b><span class="term-en">Private benefit — the benefit enjoyed by the decision maker; External benefit — the benefit enjoyed by third parties; Social benefit — the total benefit to the whole society</span>
    <div class="formula">社會利益 <b>Social benefit</b> ＝ 私人利益 <b>Private benefit</b> ＋ 外部利益 <b>External benefit</b></div>
    <p><strong>外部效應</strong>（<span class="term">external effect / externality</span>）＝ 外部成本或外部利益的統稱。有外部效應時，<strong>私人與社會的成本（利益）就出現分歧</strong>（<span class="term">divergence</span>）。</p></div>

  <div class="lab"><div class="lab-hd"><span>理解圖</span><b>成本與利益的「疊層」：市場只看得見自己那一格</b></div>
  <div style="padding:8px 14px 14px;overflow-x:auto"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 250" role="img" aria-label="兩組疊層長方形：私人成本加外部成本等於社會成本；私人利益加外部利益等於社會利益" style="min-width:540px;max-width:100%">
