<section class="pg" id="pg-EL1a">
  <div class="phead"><span class="ltr">選修一 · 第 1 節</span>
    <h1>簡單壟斷定價：MR、產量、價格與無效率</h1>
    <p class="en">Simple monopoly pricing — marginal revenue, profit-maximizing output and price, efficiency implications</p>
    <p class="lede">必修 Topic D 明文豁免了所有 MR／MC 曲線分析，但選修一<strong>要全部補回</strong>。這一節是整個選修一分數最集中的地方：一幅圖、一張數字表，就能覆蓋官方五項要求。而每年最多人失分的，只係一個動作 —— 找到 MR ＝ MC 之後，<strong>價格要在 D 曲線上讀</strong>。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="blk note"><span class="blk-lbl">官方要求（Key point (i) 逐項）</span>
    <p>Students are expected to：(i) understand and illustrate <strong>numerically</strong> the relationship between price and marginal revenue；(ii) show the relationship between <strong>demand curve and marginal revenue curve graphically</strong>；(iii) determine <strong>profit-maximizing output and price</strong> graphically and numerically；(iv) explain why simple monopoly pricing is <strong>inefficient</strong>, i.e. MB &gt; MC, and illustrate with <strong>CS, PS and DWL</strong>；(v) <strong>compare</strong> the output, price and efficiency implications between monopoly under uniform pricing and perfectly competitive market。</p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px">另有官方註腳：<em>N.B. Graphical and numerical illustrations with <strong>given</strong> demand, marginal revenue and marginal cost curves</em>。「given」兩個字很重要 —— 考試會<strong>給你</strong>三條曲線（或一張表），你唔需要自己由成本函數推導 MC，也唔需要用微積分求 MR。你的工作只是<strong>讀圖、比較、標面積</strong>。</p></div>

  <h2><span class="kp">Key point (i) 之一</span>邊際收入：為什麼 MR 一定細過 P</h2>
  <p class="h2en">Marginal revenue and why MR &lt; P under simple monopoly pricing</p>

  <div class="blk def"><span class="blk-lbl">定義</span>
    <b>簡單壟斷定價</b><span class="term-en">Simple (uniform) monopoly pricing — a monopolist charges the same single price for every unit sold to every buyer</span>
    <p>「簡單」（simple）＝「統一定價」（uniform pricing）＝<strong>所有件、所有買家，同一個價</strong>。這是下一節「價格歧視」的對照組：一旦可以就不同單位／不同買家收不同價，就不再是簡單壟斷定價。</p></div>

  <div class="blk def"><span class="blk-lbl">定義</span>
    <b>邊際收入</b><span class="term-en">Marginal revenue (MR) — the change in total revenue resulting from selling one more unit of output</span>
    <p>MR 是「多賣一件，總收入變幾多」。</p></div>

  <div class="formula">MR ＝ ΔTR ／ ΔQ　（每次多賣一件，即 ΔQ ＝ 1 時，<b>MR ＝ TR<span style="font-size:.85em">(Q)</span> − TR<span style="font-size:.85em">(Q−1)</span></b>）</div>

  <p>完全競爭下的廠商是<strong>價格接受者</strong>（<span class="term">price taker</span>），面對一條<strong>水平</strong>的需求曲線：多賣一件，價格唔變，所以 <strong>MR ＝ P</strong>。但壟斷者是<strong>價格搜索者</strong>（<span class="term">price searcher</span>），面對整個市場那條<strong>向下傾斜</strong>的需求曲線。要多賣一件，就必須<strong>減價</strong>；而在簡單（統一）定價下，減價<strong>不能只減新那一件</strong>，要<strong>連原有的每一件都一齊減</strong>。</p>

  <div class="formula">多賣一件的 MR ＝ <b>新那件的價格</b>（產量效應，＋）　−　<b>原有各件因降價而少收的總額</b>（價格效應，−）</div>

  <p>第二項一定是正數（除了賣第一件時原有件數為零），所以 <strong>MR 一定細過 P</strong>，而且產量愈大、要「連累」降價的件數愈多，MR 跌得愈快，最終可以變成<strong>負數</strong>。</p>

  <h3>完整數值示範</h3>
  <p>設市場需求為 <strong>P ＝ 12 − Q</strong>（P 以元計，Q 以件計），並設<strong>邊際成本固定為 MC ＝ $4</strong>（無固定成本，故 TC ＝ 4Q）。</p>

  <div class="tw"><table class="compact">
    <thead><tr><th class="num">Q</th><th class="num">P ＝ 12 − Q</th><th class="num">TR ＝ P × Q</th><th class="num">MR ＝ ΔTR</th><th class="num">TC ＝ 4Q</th><th class="num">利潤 π ＝ TR − TC</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td class="num">0</td><td class="num">12</td><td class="num">0</td><td class="num">—</td><td class="num">0</td><td class="num">0</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">1</td><td class="num">11</td><td class="num">11</td><td class="num">11</td><td class="num">4</td><td class="num">7</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">2</td><td class="num">10</td><td class="num">20</td><td class="num">9</td><td class="num">8</td><td class="num">12</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">3</td><td class="num">9</td><td class="num">27</td><td class="num">7</td><td class="num">12</td><td class="num">15</td></tr>
      <tr><th class="num">4</th><th class="num">8</th><th class="num">32</th><th class="num">5</th><th class="num">16</th><th class="num">16 ← 最大</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">5</td><td class="num">7</td><td class="num">35</td><td class="num">3</td><td class="num">20</td><td class="num">15</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">6</td><td class="num">6</td><td class="num">36</td><td class="num">1</td><td class="num">24</td><td class="num">12</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">7</td><td class="num">5</td><td class="num">35</td><td class="num">−1</td><td class="num">28</td><td class="num">7</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="num">8</td><td class="num">4</td><td class="num">32</td><td class="num">−3</td><td class="num">32</td><td class="num">0</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>

  <p>逐行對照 P 同 MR：Q ＝ 3 時價格 $9，但 MR 只有 $7；Q ＝ 4 時價格 $8，MR 只有 $5。<strong>每一行 MR 都細過同一行的 P</strong>，而且差距愈拉愈大（$0 → $1 → $2 → $3 …）。這條「差距」正是價格效應。</p>

  <div class="blk eg"><span class="blk-lbl">拆解：MR 到底由邊兩股力構成</span>
    <div class="tw"><table class="compact">
      <thead><tr><th>由 Q−1 賣到 Q</th><th class="num">新那件賣得的價格（＋）</th><th class="num">原有 (Q−1) 件每件少收 $1（−）</th><th class="num">MR</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th>0 → 1</th><td class="num">＋11</td><td class="num">0 × $1 ＝ 0</td><td class="num">11</td></tr>
        <tr><th>1 → 2</th><td class="num">＋10</td><td class="num">1 × $1 ＝ −1</td><td class="num">9</td></tr>
        <tr><th>2 → 3</th><td class="num">＋9</td><td class="num">2 × $1 ＝ −2</td><td class="num">7</td></tr>
        <tr><th>3 → 4</th><td class="num">＋8</td><td class="num">3 × $1 ＝ −3</td><td class="num">5</td></tr>
        <tr><th>4 → 5</th><td class="num">＋7</td><td class="num">4 × $1 ＝ −4</td><td class="num">3</td></tr>
        <tr><th>6 → 7</th><td class="num">＋5</td><td class="num">6 × $1 ＝ −6</td><td class="num">−1</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p>由 3 件加到 4 件：第 4 件賣 $8（＋$8），但為了賣得出第 4 件，價格要由 $9 跌到 $8，原有 3 件<strong>每件少收 $1</strong>（−$3）。淨增 ＝ 8 − 3 ＝ <strong>$5</strong>，正是 TR 由 27 升到 32 的差額。這就是答「why MR &lt; P」的<strong>標準寫法</strong>：先寫 ＋新件價格，再寫 −原有各件的收入損失。</p></div>

  <div class="blk trap"><span class="blk-lbl">陷阱</span>
    <p>唔好寫「因為壟斷者要減價，所以 MR 細過 P」就收工 —— 只講咗一半。閱卷要見到<strong>兩股力的比較</strong>：the monopolist gains the price of the extra unit <strong>but loses revenue on all the previous units</strong> which must now be sold at the lower price。另外，<strong>MR 可以係負數</strong>（本表 Q ≥ 7），但 <strong>P 永遠係正數</strong>；有考生把 MR 表照抄成價格表，一見負數就以為計錯。</p></div>

  <h2><span class="kp">Key point (i) 之二</span>D 曲線與 MR 曲線的圖形關係</h2>
  <p class="h2en">The graphical relationship between the demand curve and the MR curve</p>

  <p>若需求曲線是<strong>直線</strong>，寫成 <strong>P ＝ a − bQ</strong>，則 TR ＝ PQ ＝ aQ − bQ²，而</p>
  <div class="formula">D：P ＝ a − bQ　　⇒　　MR ＝ a − <b>2</b>bQ</div>
  <p>兩者的關係要背三句：</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>同一條縱軸截距</strong>（same vertical intercept ＝ a）—— 兩條線由 P 軸上同一點出發。</li>
    <li><strong>MR 的斜率是 D 的兩倍陡</strong>（MR is <span class="term">twice as steep</span> as D）。</li>
    <li><strong>MR 的橫軸截距是 D 的一半</strong>（MR cuts the Q-axis at <strong>half</strong> the horizontal intercept of D）—— 這是畫圖時最實用的一句：先畫 D，找出 D 同橫軸相交的那點，取<strong>一半</strong>，由縱軸截距拉條直線落去，就是 MR。</li>
    <li>順帶記住：<strong>MR ＝ 0 的產量正是 TR 最高的產量</strong>（本例 Q ＝ 6，TR ＝ 36），亦即需求價格彈性 ＝ 1 的那一點（接 Topic C3）。MR &gt; 0 的一段 D 屬<strong>富彈性</strong>，MR &lt; 0 的一段屬<strong>乏彈性</strong>。</li>
  </ul>

